    // out_different[i] = in[i] ^ in[i-1] with wrap-around
    // i=3: neighbour is in[0]; i=2: neighbour is in[1]; i=1: neighbour is in[0]
    // out_different[0] is not needed (in[0] has no left neighbour, but wrap makes it in[3]; specification implies only i=1..3)
